WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:02.065
A visit to an older robot.

00:02.740 --> 00:10.358
On their second walk they went over to Surveyor 3 and brought about 10 kg of it home to study, its TV camera included.

00:11.096 --> 00:16.663
That camera is on show at the Smithsonian's National Air and Space Museum in Washington.
